Input: {"question": "In which significant event was Generating control settings for a chemical reactor involved?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 81, "text": "Title: The Crucial Filing: Unveiling the Breakthrough in Chemical Reactor Control"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 83, "end": 208, "text": "In the realm of chemical engineering, the quest for precision and efficiency has long been a driving force behind innovation."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 209, "end": 407, "text": "One such groundbreaking achievement was the development of a novel approach to generating control settings for chemical reactors, a milestone that would forever change the landscape of the industry."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 408, "end": 545, "text": "This narrative delves into the fascinating story behind US patent 11520310, a testament to human ingenuity and the power of perseverance."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 546, "end": 600, "text": "It was a typical day at the research facility when Dr."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 601, "end": 679, "text": "Rachel Kim, a renowned chemical engineer, stumbled upon an intriguing problem."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 680, "end": 828, "text": "The traditional methods of controlling chemical reactors were plagued by inefficiencies, resulting in subpar yields and compromised product quality."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 829, "end": 924, "text": "Rachel was determined to find a solution, driven by her passion for optimizing complex systems."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 925, "end": 1085, "text": "As she delved deeper into the issue, Rachel realized that the key to unlocking superior reactor performance lay in the development of advanced control settings."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1086, "end": 1250, "text": "These settings would need to be tailored to the specific reactor design, taking into account a multitude of variables such as temperature, pressure, and flow rates."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1251, "end": 1305, "text": "The challenge was daunting, but Rachel was undeterred."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1306, "end": 1474, "text": "Months of tireless research and experimentation ensued, with Rachel pouring over theoretical models, conducting simulations, and collaborating with her team of experts."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1475, "end": 1626, "text": "The breakthrough finally came when she discovered a novel algorithm that could generate optimal control settings for a wide range of chemical reactors."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1627, "end": 1801, "text": "This innovation had the potential to revolutionize the industry, enabling the production of higher-quality chemicals while minimizing waste and reducing environmental impact."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1802, "end": 1945, "text": "The significance of Rachel's discovery was not lost on her colleagues, who urged her to file for a patent to protect her intellectual property."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1946, "end": 2050, "text": "Thus began the legal filing process, a crucial step in securing recognition for her groundbreaking work."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2051, "end": 2171, "text": "The patent application, US 11520310, was meticulously crafted to showcase the novelty and utility of Rachel's invention."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2172, "end": 2380, "text": "As the patent office reviewed the application, Rachel's team continued to refine their invention, testing it on various reactor designs and fine-tuning the algorithm to ensure its versatility and reliability."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2381, "end": 2504, "text": "The results were nothing short of astonishing, with reactors operating at unprecedented levels of efficiency and precision."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2505, "end": 2588, "text": "The patent was finally granted, a testament to Rachel's perseverance and ingenuity."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2589, "end": 2776, "text": "The filing of US 11520310 marked a significant event in the history of chemical engineering, as it paved the way for widespread adoption of advanced control settings in chemical reactors."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 100, "text": "**HISTORIC MOMENT FOR SCIENCE AND MONARCHY: ROYAL ASSENT GRANTED FOR CHEMICAL REACTOR BREAKTHROUGH**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 102, "end": 314, "text": "In a rare convergence of scientific innovation and monarchical tradition, Her Majesty Queen Elizabeth II has granted royal assent to a groundbreaking patent for generating control settings for a chemical reactor."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 315, "end": 499, "text": "This milestone marks a significant event in the history of scientific progress, as the monarch's formal approval paves the way for widespread adoption of this revolutionary technology."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 500, "end": 627, "text": "The patent, numbered US 11520310, was developed by a team of researchers at the prestigious University of Cambridge, led by Dr."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 628, "end": 684, "text": "Sophia Patel, a renowned expert in chemical engineering."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 685, "end": 701, "text": "According to Dr."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 702, "end": 889, "text": "Patel, the new control settings will enable chemical reactors to operate with unprecedented efficiency, reducing energy consumption and environmental impact while increasing productivity."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 890, "end": 972, "text": "\"We are thrilled that our work has received the highest level of recognition,\" Dr."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 973, "end": 1010, "text": "Patel said in an exclusive interview."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1011, "end": 1147, "text": "\"The royal assent is a testament to the potential of this technology to transform the chemical industry and benefit society as a whole.\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1148, "end": 1304, "text": "The royal assent ceremony, held at Buckingham Palace, was attended by dignitaries from the scientific community, government officials, and industry leaders."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1305, "end": 1464, "text": "The Queen, resplendent in her ceremonial attire, formally approved the patent, marking a rare occasion where the monarch has intervened in a scientific matter."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1465, "end": 1616, "text": "\"This is a momentous day for British science and innovation,\" said Lord Martin Rees, Astronomer Royal and a prominent advocate for scientific progress."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1617, "end": 1770, "text": "\"The royal assent sends a powerful message about the importance of investing in research and development, and we are grateful for Her Majesty's support.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1771, "end": 1996, "text": "Data from the University of Cambridge suggests that the new control settings could reduce energy consumption in chemical reactors by up to 30%, resulting in significant cost savings and a decrease in greenhouse gas emissions."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1997, "end": 2119, "text": "The technology is expected to have far-reaching implications for industries ranging from pharmaceuticals to manufacturing."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2120, "end": 2289, "text": "As news of the royal assent spread, shares in companies involved in chemical production surged, with investors eager to capitalize on the potential of this breakthrough."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2290, "end": 2480, "text": "Industry leaders are already exploring ways to integrate the new control settings into their operations, with several major corporations announcing plans to invest heavily in the technology."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2481, "end": 2678, "text": "In a statement, the Prime Minister's office praised the Queen's decision, saying, \"This is a proud moment for British science and a testament to our country's commitment to innovation and progress."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2679, "end": 2776, "text": "We look forward to seeing the positive impact of this technology on our economy and environment.\""}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["filing of US patent 11520310", "royal assent granted by Her Majesty Queen Elizabeth II"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "filing of US patent 11520310", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "royal assent granted by Her Majesty Queen Elizabeth II", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
